            description: "Plant: Very vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Large size, good firmness, black, fair shape, excellent flavor, very early ripening. Yield: Very high. Market: Primarily fresh but processes well. Large-scale commercial value rating: 1"
        },
        {
            type: "Blackberry",
