            description: "Plant: Vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Medium size, firm, black, excellent uniform shape, excellent flavor, very early ripening. Yield: High. Market: Primarily fresh but processes well. Large-scale commercial value rating: 1"
        },
        {
            type: "Blackberry",
