            category: "Trailing blackberries for Oregon",
            description: "Plant: Very vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Large size, soft, dark purple, fair shape, excellent flavor. Yield: Very high. Market: Processed. Large-scale commercial value rating: 2. Comment: Very soft and does not hold up in heat"
        },
        {
            type: "Blackberry",
            name: "Cascade",
            category: "Trailing blackberries for Oregon",
            harvest_time_unparsed: "early",
            description: "Plant: Vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Small to medium size, soft, purple, excellent flavor, early ripening. Yield: Low to medium. Market: Processed. Large-scale commercial value rating: 3. Comment: Not productive enough"
