            description: "Plant: Very vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Medium size, soft, black, lumpy shape, excellent flavor, early ripening. Yield: Low to medium. Market: Primarily fresh but processes well. Large-scale commercial value rating: 3. Comment: Was grown commonly in California for U-pick and fresh sales, but in Oregon it is lower yielding and more sensitive to winter cold injury than Marion"
        },
        {
            type: "Blackberry",
