            category: "Blackberry/red raspberry hybrids for Oregon",
            description: "Plant: Vigorous, thornless. Fruit: Small to medium size, lumpy, purple, fair flavor. Yield: Medium. Market: Fresh. Large-scale commercial value rating: 3. Comment: Source says this thornless cultivar is the color of Boysen but was developed in California and does not have the flavor of the original Boysen"
        },
        {
            type: "Blackberry",
