            category: "Blackberry/red raspberry hybrids for Oregon",
            description: "Plant: Vigorous, thorny. Fruit: Large size, soft, lumpy, purple, unique and very good flavor. Yield: High. Market: Processed. Large-scale commercial value rating: 1. Comment: Source table notes this is often called boysenberry; source also says Nectarberry and Youngberry are very similar to Boysen"
        },
